# VyaparAI uses one env file PER APP (not this root file):
#   backend/.env.example   -> copy to backend/.env          (server secrets live here or in Secret Manager)
#   frontend/.env.example  -> copy to frontend/.env.local   (public NEXT_PUBLIC_* values only)
# Firebase Admin service-account keys must be stored OUTSIDE the repository.
# See docs/FIREBASE_SETUP.md.
